---
title: Chocolate Marshmallow Sauce
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Sauces & Dressings
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@chocolate chips{1%6-oz pkg}
@evaporated milk{1/2%c}
@large marshmallows{10}
@butter{1/4%c}
@sugar{1/2%c}
@vanilla{1/2%tsp}

Combine chocolate chips, butter, sugar, evaporated milk, vanilla and marshmallows in top of double boiler. Stir until well blended. Cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally. Serve warm over cake, ice cream, etc.
